OL,3,GNEWSAMan running in memory of dad who
OL,4,Adied after race
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man running a half marathon in memory
OL,7,Fof his father, who died after taking
OL,8,Fpart in the same race last year, said
OL,9,Fhe was "excited" about Sunday's event.
OL,11,FMatthew Knight will set off on the 13.1
OL,12,Fmile (21km) Potters 'Arf course in
OL,13,FStoke-on-Trent in tribute to his dad,
OL,14,FTony Knight, who became known as "Tony
OL,15,Fthe tiger" after he donned a tiger suit
OL,16,Fduring previous races.
OL,18,FMatthew and members of his family will
OL,19,Fwear tiger print t-shirts with images
OL,20,Fof Tony on their backs.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
