OL,3,GNEWSAMan running in memory of dad who
OL,4,Adied after race
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He loved the running community within
OL,7,FStoke," Matthew said. "They've been
OL,8,Fmassively supportive of what we're
OL,9,Fdoing, and what he did with many years
OL,10,Fof running around the area."
